+
+# Implement JSON Patch (RFC 6902)
+
+Added `applyPatch(document, patch)` in `src/index.ts`, supporting add, remove, replace, move, copy and
+test. It validates the whole patch first, then applies the operations in order to a private
+`structuredClone` of the document, so inputs are never mutated and a failure leaves no partial result.
+Inserted values are cloned too, so the result shares no structure with the patch. Pointer parsing was
+factored out of `resolvePointer` into `parsePointer` and is reused. Tests in `test/patch.test.ts` cover
+the RFC's appendix A examples, error paths, non-mutation and prototype-key safety; run with `npm test`.
+
+Decisions: see dl-002 (builds on dl-001).
